		(property "Note" "In parallel with the 470 ohm pulldown, not instead of it. Ron 5 ohm dominates the pulldown by ~2000x -- modelled kill time 23 ns, with no MCU involvement at all, which is what makes it work against a HUNG MCU and not only a reset one."
