		(property "Note" "Common pin on the sense node, K2 to 5V_MAIN: holds the comparator input inside its rail when VIN is at 73.3 V. A1 OPEN -- the lower diode would clamp the negative excursion the comparator exists to see. Leakage lifts the sense node, which makes the clamp release EARLIER, the safe direction."
